mapping "V5352.1" source="V5352" target="274913009" relationship=source_is_narrower_than_target {
    confidence 0.03 scheme="vocabmod-se-confidence@1"
    comment "en" """
        Source V5352 (Swedish national extension) = ICD-10 V53.5 SNOMED CT 274913009 + Swedish activity
        dimension (paid work). Target SNOMED CT 433930 (274913009) = (standard concept, Event). Athena
        crosswalk maps parent V53.5 -> 433930 (+ 444074); the Swedish code layers an activity-context
        suffix that has no SNOMED CT standard equivalent. Target is the most specific standard concept
        whose semantics the source falls within; the activity dimension and occupant role are dropped.
        mapping_type=broader because target subsumes every clinical meaning the source carries that has
        a standard representation; confidence (verified crosswalk via V53.5, small well-understood
        breadth mismatch from the activity-dimension loss).
        """
}
