        occupation). Target SNOMED CT 433930 (274913009) is the standard concept the Athena crosswalk
        resolves V53.5 to; the activity suffix has no SNOMED CT equivalent. mapping_type=broader (target
        subsumes source minus dropped activity/role); confidence (verified crosswalk, small breadth
